# Actors, the resident, weather, events and city life's crowds running from one seed: the same script must give
# byte-identical screenshots and saves (compared by the determinism_check test).
set unlock all
set season spring
set clock day
place cottage @32,30 0
place coop @26,32 0
place planter @24,33 0
set shower now
set camera 30 30 1
fast 15
wait 4
shot determinism.png
# The crowded Forum: city life from the same seed, drawn the same, to the pixel.
set day 9
set time 0.1667
set world forum 1
fast 10
wait 4
shot determinism_forum.png
quit
